- Fit Page in Window: Ctrl + 0

Section 2: Selection & Transformation Tools
- Selection Tool: V
- Direct Selection Tool: A
- Rotate Tool: R
- Scale Tool: S

Section 3: Text & Typography Shortcuts
- Type Tool: T
- Increase Font Size: Ctrl + Shift + >
- Decrease Font Size: Ctrl + Shift + <
- Align Left / Center / Right: Ctrl + Shift + L / C / R

Section 4: Object & Layer Management
- Group Objects: Ctrl + G
- Ungroup Objects: Ctrl + Shift + G
- Lock Object: Ctrl + L
- Unlock All: Ctrl + Alt + L

Section 5: Color & Swatches
- Toggle Fill & Stroke: X
- Swap Fill & Stroke: Shift + X
- Apply Color: ,

Section 6: Frame & Image Fitting
- Fit Content Proportionally: Ctrl + Alt + Shift + E
- Fill Frame Proportionally: Ctrl + Alt + Shift + C
- Center Content: Ctrl + Shift + E

Section 7: Table Formatting
- Insert Table: Ctrl + Alt + Shift + T
- Select Row / Column: Ctrl + Alt + 3 / 4

Section 8: Display & Screen Modes
- Toggle Normal / Preview Mode: W
- Presentation Mode: Shift + W

Section 9: Pages & Navigation
- Go to Page: Ctrl + J
- Next Page / Previous Page: Shift + Page Down / Page Up

