"published_at":"2024-08-14","created_at":"2024-08-14"},{"id":"b4","title":"Exploring the Intersection of Multimedia and Social Media","slug":"exploring-the-intersection-of-multimedia-and-social-media","category":"SOCIAL MEDIA","excerpt":"How visual storytelling, 3D renders, and short-form video motion transform modern digital brand marketing.","content":"The Significance of multimedia has further amplified the potential of social media, allowing users to create and share a wide variety of content. This blog article explores the importance of multimedia on social media, its evolution, impact, and potential future developments.\n\nTypes of Multimedia on Social Media:\n- Images: Images convey emotion, highlight product benefits, and establish visual brand identity.\n- Videos: Short-form videos provide dynamic storytelling with high retention.\n- Infographics: Complex data visualised into easily digestible visual graphics.\n- Audio & Podcasts: Soundscapes and podcast clips build personal creator-audience connections.\n\nAccording to Cisco, video traffic dominates consumer internet traffic. Businesses utilizing multimedia storytelling create stronger brand engagement and higher conversion rates.","featured_image":"/blog-poster-4.jpg","author":"Prism Research Team","status":"Published","published_at":"2024-08-16","created_at":"2024-08-16"},{"id":"b5","title":"Why should I opt for PRISM MULTIMEDIA to boost my career? Top 10 Reasons","slug":"why-should-i-opt-for-prism-multimedia-to-boost-my-career-here-are-top-10-reasons","category":"COMPANY","excerpt":"Discover why Prism Multimedia stands out as Hyderabad’s premier training institute since 1999.","content":"Choosing the right training institute is the first critical step towards a thriving creative career.\n\nTop Reasons to Choose Prism Multimedia:\n1. Experienced Faculty with 15+ years of live studio production experience.\n2. Industry-Aligned Curriculum updated continuously for modern agency tools.\n3. High-End Studio Workstations equipped with Wacom tablets, GPU workstations, and software suites.\n4. Dedicated 100% Placement Assistance connecting students directly with hiring partners.\n5. Real Client Case Studies & Portfolio Building.","featured_image":"/blog-poster-5.jpg","author":"Anjee Yarlagadda","status":"Published","published_at":"2024-08-18","created_at":"2024-08-18"},{"id":"b6","title":"Motion Graphics in User Interface (UI) Design","slug":"motion-graphics-in-user-interface-ui-design","category":"UI DESIGN","excerpt":"Transform static app screens into fluid, intuitive visual experiences with UI motion principles.","content":"Motion graphics play an indispensable role in modern user interface (UI) design by guiding user attention, clarifying navigation flows, and providing instant visual feedback.\n\nCore UI Motion Principles:\n- Easing Curves: Natural acceleration and deceleration for smooth modal transitions.\n- Micro-Interactions: Animated heart likes, button press bounces, and loading states.\n- Spatial Orientation: Card expansion animations that maintain user mental model context.","featured_image":"/blog-poster-6.jpg","author":"Prism Design Studio","status":"Published","published_at":"2024-08-20","created_at":"2024-08-20"}]}]]}]
